abitants at the 2010 census. It has a total area of 10,213 square kilometers (3,943 mi2).","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0e/Maoling_10.jpg/330px-Maoling_10.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xianyang"},"twins":["Q49218","Q1476","Q1947531","Q2837","Q273798"],"climate":{"temp":[1.3,5,11,17.5,22.5,27.2,28.8,27.4,21.8,15.8,8.6,2.4],"rain":[9,13,23,40,69,84,124,114,125,60,27,6],"cloud":[60,68,67,69,73,73,69,68,71,65,54,54]},"land":true}